sequenceDiagram
  accTitle: Caller timeout and server action can coexist
  accDescr: Service action precedes a response the caller does not observe in time; local deadline cleanup leaves the caller uncertain and does not erase the action or establish retry safety.
participant C as Caller
  participant S as Service
  C->>S: Command
  S->>S: Action occurs
  S--xC: Response not observed in time
  C->>C: Deadline: stop waiting<br/>request owned cleanup
  Note over C,S: Caller outcome: unknown<br/>Earlier action is not erased
  Note over C,S: Retry: suitable semantics<br/>Replayable body, budget<br/>Bounded retry policy
